<!-- ── MISSION ── -->
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="mission-title">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="mission-card">
      <div class="eyebrow on-dark">Our mission</div>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="mission-title">Connect people to homes across Kenya, without the middleman</h2>
      <div class="section-body">
        <p>Property hunting in Kenya has always worked the same way: you need a home, you call an agent, the agent calls another agent, and by the time you see the apartment you owe someone a commission before you've even moved in. It's a system that benefits everyone except the people looking for a home.</p>
        <p>Nyumba254 cuts through that. Sellers post their properties directly for a small one-time listing fee, shown before they pay, and their first listing is free. Buyers browse, shortlist and message sellers straight from the listing, with no intermediaries and no commission on the deal. Every listing is checked by our team, usually within a few hours.</p>
        <p>We believe the rental and property market in every corner of Kenya, not just the big cities, deserves a modern platform that puts landlords and tenants in the same room, digitally, and then gets out of the way.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

