<section class="section section-alt" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="split top">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">How we got here</div>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="story-title">A problem we saw <em>everywhere in Kenya</em>, not just one city</h2>
        <div class="section-body">
          <p>Nyumba254 started from a genuine frustration: it is hard to find a decent, affordable home anywhere in Kenya without going through a chain of agents, each taking a cut. This isn't a one-city problem. It's how the market works almost everywhere.</p>
          <p>The idea was simple: build a clean, honest listing platform where owners post directly and buyers find what they need without the noise, designed from day one to work for any town or county.</p>
        </div>
        <!-- EDIT: set datetime="YYYY-MM" on each <time> below (e.g. datetime="2025-06") and the page will show "June 2025 · The idea".
             While datetime is empty, only the phase name is shown, so nothing on the page is invented. -->
        <ol class="timeline">
          <li class="timeline-item">
            <span class="timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <time class="timeline-year" datetime="" data-phase="The idea">The idea</time>
            <h3 class="timeline-title">Agent fees are a nationwide problem</h3>
            <p class="timeline-text">One too many encounters with agents charging commission just to show an apartment made it clear this wasn't unique to any one place. It needed a solution built for the whole country.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="timeline-item">
            <span class="timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <time class="timeline-year" datetime="" data-phase="Building">Building</time>
            <h3 class="timeline-title">A platform built from the ground up</h3>
            <p class="timeline-text">Search and filters, direct seller contact, viewing requests and M-Pesa listing fees, all designed to scale to any part of Kenya.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="timeline-item">
            <span class="timeline-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <time class="timeline-year" datetime="" data-phase="Launch">Launch</time>
